  "boundaries": [
    "Small synthetic fixtures in owned local temporary storage; no live sync, production data, remote host or external volume changes.",
    "Original production accepts the unordered public API inputs. Normal historical sync collector sorts blocks before extracting rows; no ordinary production sync failure is claimed.",
